      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have similar issue.\n\nVRChat happens hangs up completely random. (not completely hangs up, almost)\n\nSometimes, 5 seconds or few minutes. \n\nWhen it's happens, frame rate dropped to 2 to 5 FPS on desktop mode.\n\nNo logs recorded. Just hang up and GPU Clock is dropped to idle.\n\nNot same issue with other DirectX games.\n\nIf crashed with that, EAC error is shown occasionally.\n\nMine is:\n\nRyzen 5800X\n\n32GB RAM @ 3200MHz\n\nRadeon 6800\n\nWindows 11\n\nRadeon Software 25.11.1 (I've tried 25.8.1, 25.9.1. But it's not solved)",
