  "details": "Open VRChat\n\nGo to random world with 1 other player\n\nDo not use any toggles on your avatars\n\nWait\n\nEventually VRChat stops responding. Sometimes this is after a few minutes, sometimes it takes hours.\n\nVRChat will only hang for 10-30 seconds at a time, then return to normal.\n\nThese app hangs will increase in frequency as you keep going until the game eventually fully crashes.\n\nSteamVR menu is fully functional during this and so is the rest of my Desktop.\n\nThis issue was introduced in Build 1645 I believe and it got fixed in 1647 but unfortunately it's back.\n\nMy best guess would be some kind of memory leak since I can comfortably go to events with 80+ people and show everyone's avatar except for very poors.\n\nMy specs:\n\nRyzen 5800X3D\n\nRadeon 7800XT\n\n32GB RAM @ 3000MHz\n\nGame is installed on M.2 SSD\n\nGPU driver: Adrenalin Edition Version 25.5.1",
